    "magnetic_energy": "Em(t) = (1/2) * L * (i^2) = E0 * sin^2(omega0 * t)",
    "total_energy_conservation": "E_total = Ee(t) + Em(t) == E0 = 0.5 J (恒定守恒)",
    "loop_kvl": "u_C - u_L = q/C - L*di/dt = 0；u_L 按电流方向采用被动约定"
  },
